sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant MCP as MCP Tools
    participant API as External Service

    User->>Agent: Request IP attribution
    Agent->>MCP: Query ASN & Reputation
    MCP->>API: Fetch Whois / OTX / AbuseIPDB
    API-->>MCP: Return threat indicators
    MCP-->>Agent: Formatted intelligence data
    Agent->>Agent: Correlate & Assess confidence
    Agent-->>User: Present investigation report
